{"id":"fbf7ed6af95f19de","group":"28","path":"28/28-df-fourier-influence.md","title":"Coordinate Influence and Discrete Derivative","display":"df-fourier-influence — Coordinate Influence and Discrete Derivative","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-df-fourier-influence","aliases":["28-df-fourier-influence"],"display":"df-fourier-influence — Coordinate Influence and Discrete Derivative","depends_on":["[[28-df-fourier-transform]]"],"source_reference":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach, Note 22.21; local influence definitions","source_printed_pages":"478–479","source_pdf_pages":"504–505","source_statement_verified":false,"source_proof_reviewed":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-df-fourier-influence"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-df-fourier-influence</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-fourier-influence — Coordinate Influence and Discrete Derivative"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"fcbf14393ebfa830\" href=\"?note=fcbf14393ebfa830\" title=\"28-df-fourier-transform\">28-df-fourier-transform</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach, Note 22.21; local influence definitions"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"478–479"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"504–505"},{"key":"source_statement_verified","html":"false"},{"key":"source_proof_reviewed","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f:\\{-1,1\\}^n\\to\\{-1,1\\}\">\\(f:\\{-1,1\\}^n\\to\\{-1,1\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\{-1,1\\}^n\">\\(x\\in\\{-1,1\\}^n\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i,j\\in[n]\">\\(i,j\\in[n]\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x^{\\oplus i}\">\\(x^{\\oplus i}\\)</span> 表示翻转第 i 坐标后的向量。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\widehat f\">\\(\\widehat f\\)</span> 与均匀内积见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"fcbf14393ebfa830\" href=\"?note=fcbf14393ebfa830\" title=\"28-df-fourier-transform\">28-df-fourier-transform</a>；下式定义坐标影响、总影响和离散导数。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"x^{\\oplus i}_j\\coloneqq(-1)^{\\mathbf1[j=i]}x_j,\\qquad\\partial_i f(x)\\coloneqq\\frac{f(x)-f(x^{\\oplus i})}{2}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[x^{\\oplus i}_j\\coloneqq(-1)^{\\mathbf1[j=i]}x_j,\\qquad\\partial_i f(x)\\coloneqq\\frac{f(x)-f(x^{\\oplus i})}{2}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Inf}_i(f)\\coloneqq2^{-n}|\\{x\\in\\{-1,1\\}^n:f(x)\\ne f(x^{\\oplus i})\\}|,\\qquad\\operatorname{Inf}(f)\\coloneqq\\sum_{i=1}^n\\operatorname{Inf}_i(f).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Inf}_i(f)\\coloneqq2^{-n}|\\{x\\in\\{-1,1\\}^n:f(x)\\ne f(x^{\\oplus i})\\}|,\\qquad\\operatorname{Inf}(f)\\coloneqq\\sum_{i=1}^n\\operatorname{Inf}_i(f).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>这是书中 Fourier 与 isoperimetry 讨论的本地可复用补充。由于 f 取 ±1，离散导数平方正好是翻转是否改变函数值的指示量；结合 Parseval 可得 Inf_i(f)=sum_{S containing i} fhat(S)^2，后者是推论而非额外定义。源文 Note 22.21 提供边界/自相关观点，但未定位本节点这组定义的完整直接陈述。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>来源：Note 22.21; local influence definitions，印刷页 478–479，PDF 页 504–505。源文提供主题与工具，本条形式结论是本地补充。未声称完整复核原书证明。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-fourier-transform","status":"resolved","id":"fcbf14393ebfa830","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-fourier-transform]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-fourier-transform","status":"resolved","id":"fcbf14393ebfa830","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\widehat f$ 与均匀内积见 [[28-df-fourier-transform]]；下式定义坐标影响、总影响和离散导数。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}","display":false},{"tex":"f:\\{-1,1\\}^n\\to\\{-1,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"x\\in\\{-1,1\\}^n","display":false},{"tex":"i,j\\in[n]","display":false},{"tex":"x^{\\oplus i}","display":false},{"tex":"\\widehat f","display":false},{"tex":"x^{\\oplus i}_j\\coloneqq(-1)^{\\mathbf1[j=i]}x_j,\\qquad\\partial_i f(x)\\coloneqq\\frac{f(x)-f(x^{\\oplus i})}{2}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Inf}_i(f)\\coloneqq2^{-n}|\\{x\\in\\{-1,1\\}^n:f(x)\\ne f(x^{\\oplus i})\\}|,\\qquad\\operatorname{Inf}(f)\\coloneqq\\sum_{i=1}^n\\operatorname{Inf}_i(f).","display":true}],"bytes":1762,"backlinks":[{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-228","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"第22章：傅里叶分析工具：[[28-df-fourier-influence]]、[[28-thm-parseval]]。"}],"outgoing":["fcbf14393ebfa830"]}